    {
     "title": "Altschmerz: Josephine’s Beth de Araújo on the pain, power and darkness of her searing feature",
     "link": "https://letterboxd.com/journal/josephine-beth-de-araujo-interview/",
     "time": "2026-11-21T06:39:54+13:00",
     "img": "https://a.ltrbxd.com/resized/sm/upload/oo/uy/it/nm/ugdAllzWVR5b5RFE3xy5tCuXYA4-0-960-0-540-crop-fill.jpg?k=7ee56534ab",
     "intro": "Josephine writer-director Beth de Araújo tells Ella Kemp about the pain of the feature’s production journey, the care taken with her young leading actor, and the key cinematic inspirations that helped shape the film’s…",
     "category": "Interview"
